#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:512
msgid "Block translation reuses"
msgstr "块翻译重用"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:494
msgid ""
"Block-level translation cache shared across posts. When enabled, identical "
"blocks (same markup, language pair, and glossary) are served from memory "
"instead of calling the AI again. Configure in Settings → Behavior."
msgstr ""
"跨帖子共享的块级翻译缓存。启用时，相同的块（相同的标记、语言对和词汇表）将从内存中提供，而不是再次调用 AI。在 设置 → 行为 中进行配置。"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:154
msgid "Browser language redirect"
msgstr "浏览器语言重定向"

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:289
msgid "Built-in preset instructions:"
msgstr "内置预设指令："

#: ai/assets/block-action.js:71
msgid "Bulletize (•-prefixed)"
msgstr "项目符号（•-前缀）"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:170
msgid ""
"Cache translated equivalents at the block level so reusable content (shared "
"footers, sidebars, accordions, boilerplate-heavy legal sections) does not "
"pay an API call every time. When enabled, the translation flow parses each "
"post into blocks, looks each block up in the cache, and sends only uncached "
"blocks to the AI in a single batched request. Glossary edits and Compliance "
"preset changes automatically invalidate affected cached translations. View "
"statistics and clear the cache under Maintenance."
msgstr ""
"在块级缓存已翻译的等价内容，以避免每次调用 "
"API（如共享页脚、侧边栏、手风琴、法律条款）都要支付一次调用费用。启用后，翻译流程会将每篇文章拆分为块，查找缓存中的内容，只将未缓存的块批量发送给 "
"AI。词汇表编辑和合规预设更改会自动使受影响的缓存翻译失效。可在维护中查看统计信息和清除缓存。"

